<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Steel lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Steel lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Michelle Galanter Applebaum lowered her rating on Olympic Steel Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst cited the stock's valuation and lowered her 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.65 from $1.78.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Continued strong spot market steel prices are creating more margin pressure than we had expected,&quot; the analyst said in a summary report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 2-1/8 to 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
